iving a firearm","evidence_verified":true,"key":"population","score":75},{"assessment":"Substantially alters how firearms laws apply across state lines and provides specific legal defenses and private rights of action against state or local restrictions.","evidence":"preempts most state and local laws related to concealed carry and establishes a private right of action for a person adversely affected","evidence_verified":true,"key":"magnitude","score":70},{"assessment":"The source material does not state specific federal spending or revenue figures, though it creates potential court costs and attorney fee awards.","evidence":"the court shall award the prevailing defendant a reasonable attorney's fee","evidence_verified":true,"key":"fiscal","score":25},{"assessment":"Amends federal law to establish a new statutory framework that overrides state and local concealed carry statutes and creates new legal remedies.","evidence":"amend title 18, United States Code, to provide a means by which nonresidents of a State whose residents may carry concealed firearms may also do so in the State","evidence_verified":true,"key":"scope","score":75},{"assessment":"Permanent statutory change affecting interstate travel and firearms possession nationwide.","evidence":"The amendments made by this section shall take effect 90 days after the date of the enactment of this Act.","evidence_verified":true,"key":"duration","score":80}],"missing_information":["Specific data on the exact number of individuals who would carry firearms across state lines.","Detailed estimates of federal fiscal or budgetary impacts."],"rationale":"This bill establishes a nationwide framework allowing individuals with valid concealed carry permits from one state to carry concealed handguns in other states that permit concealed carry, preempting conflicting state and local laws and creating private rights of action and legal defenses.","score":75},"importance_meta":{"generated_at":"2026-10-27T13:10:31+00:00","model":"